    "detailed_description": "This is a Demo version. We're in process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRevenant is a 2D pixel-art style shooting game set in the near future.<br />\r\nEnjoy the fun of the main character Beta sweeping away his enemies to get freedom!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent than typical 2D shooting games, We have a unique system called &quot;Precise Aim&quot;<br />\r\nThe hit detection only occurs when the cursor is aiming enemy's hitbox.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith this unique system, you can enjoy our energetic battle!<br />\r\nThanks!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is chungkang college of cultural industries graduation project.<br />\r\nSorry for a lot of bugs :(<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContact us<br />\r\nTeam Leader - Hwanjin You<br />\r\nhwanjin771@naver.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Special Thanks-<br />\r\nKOR-&gt;JPN - Masa Kei",
